{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0277","paragraphs":[{"id":"p9eec9b2b1285-1","text":"晚晴风歇。"},{"id":"p5de1754f1d1c-1","text":"一夜春折威。"},{"id":"p41c76bb4224a-1","text":"脉脉花疏天淡，云来去、数枝雪。"},{"id":"pd4bb7dae0b51-1","text":"胜绝。"},{"id":"p3b8b13ea365c-1","text":"愁亦绝。"},{"id":"p07a58fb3ead7-1","text":"此情谁共说。"},{"id":"pc266c1426e83-1","text":"惟有两行低雁，知人倚、画楼月。"}]}